      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtaale na būdūla bo ng'wa Modekai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Ahasuelo ūbatūūlīla shilagīlo sha kūlīpa goodi a banhū ba mu būtemi bokwe, pye hose hose nū kū majinga nūūlū gabize galī kūle na ginehe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shītwa shakwe sha būdūla na nguzu shandīkilwe mu shitabo sha mihayo ya batemi ba Bamedi na Baajemi, nū būtaale bo ng'wa Modekai ūmo akangūngūhīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Modekai akabiza wa kabīlī ū kūfuma a halī ntemi ū ng'wikūjo; ū kū Bayudaya ūbiza nkūjiwa ntaale no, nīyo a badūgū bakwe bakang'winha ikūjo itaale no, nguno wītaga mihayo ya kūbagunanha a banhū b'ihanga lyakwe, na wafunyaga mihayo ya kūbenhela mhola a banhū bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
